{title: Shout Hosanna}
{artist: Larry Holder / Elton Smith}
{time: 4/4}
{key: C}
{tempo: 136}

Verse 1
[C]Shout [D]Hosanna, [Am7]Shout Hosanna!
[F]Shout [C]Hosanna, [Em7]Shout [Am7]Hosanna!
[E7]Blessed is He who [G]comes in the name,
Singing, [Em7]blessed is [G]He who comes in the [C]name
Of the Lord.

Chorus
[F]Shout [G]Hosanna in [Em7]the [Am7]highest.
(Bring your [C]praises to the Lord).
He [Dm7]is [G]coming to [Em7]redeem us.
[Am7](By the power of His Word).
Shout [G]Hosanna [Am7]as we welcome the [D]Lord.

Verse 2
[D]Shout Hosanna, [Am7]Shout [E]Hosanna!
[G]Shout Hosanna, Shout [A#]Hosanna!
[C]Lift up your voices, and [Em7]join in the [G]song
To the One in whose grace we now live and belong
[G7]He is King!
{c: Repeat Chorus}
Shout [G]Hosanna in the [Am7]highest.
(Bring your praises to the Lord).
[Dm7]He [Am7]is [G]coming to redeem [Am7]us.
(By [Cmaj7]the power of His [F]Word).
Shout [G]Hosanna [Am7]as we welcome the [G]Lord.

Verse 3
[G]Shout [D]Hosanna, [Am7]Shout [A#maj7]Hosanna!
[Am]Shout Hosanna, [Am7]Shout [Am7]Hosanna!
[D]Come to [C]the table [C]and sup with the [G]Lord.
With [C]abundant rejoicing [G]we'll [G]drink from His Word.
He is life!
[F]{c: Repeat Chorus}
Shout Hosanna in the highest.
[Am7](Bring your [C]praises to the Lord).
He is coming to redeem [Am7]us.
(By [C]the power of His Word).
Shout Hosanna [Am7]as [Am]we welcome [D]the [Cmaj7]Lord.
[Am7]Shout Hosanna!
